OL,3,CWelsh spirit brand AU Vodka agrees
OL,4,C#500m takeover
OL,6,FWelsh spirit brand, AU Vodka has
OL,7,Fagreed a #500m takeover by US drinks
OL,8,Fgiant Sazerac.
OL,10,FThe company, which produces flavoured
OL,11,Fvodkas in gold bottles, was valued at
OL,12,Faround #500 million, according to
OL,13,Freports.
OL,15,FCo-founders Charlie Morgan and Jackson
OL,16,FQuinn are expected to net around #100
OL,17,Fmillion each from the takeover deal.
OL,19,FThe Swansea founders began the brand
OL,20,Fin 2015, before expanding with backing
OL,21,Ffrom DJ Charlie Sloth.
