OL,3,CWelsh spirit brand AU Vodka agrees
OL,4,C#500m takeover
OL,6,FSazerac, which also makes the cocktail
OL,7,Fbrand BuzzBallz, said on Monday 17
OL,8,FAugust that it struck a ''binding
OL,9,Fagreement'' to buy the popular vodka
OL,10,Fbrand.
OL,12,FIt said the deal will help the spirits
OL,13,Fgroup to deepen its presence in the UK.
OL,15,FAU Vodka currently employs more than
OL,16,F80 people and saw its turnover jump to
OL,17,F#82.8 million in April 2025.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/3
