OL,3,CWelsh spirit brand AU Vodka agrees
OL,4,C#500m takeover
OL,6,FThe company saw rapid growth through a
OL,7,Fstrong social media presence and
OL,8,Fendorsements from celebrities, such as
OL,9,FFloyd Mayweather.
OL,11,FThe move is still subject to
OL,12,Fregulatory conditions and is expected
OL,13,Fto complete ''within weeks'', the US
OL,14,Ffirm said.
